BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Las Malinches presents: La Telenovela
DTSTART:20260905T223000
DTEND:20260905T223000
UID:e5ee141269f383cb52ab0af44d4c59b1@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Sapphic reggaetón &amp\; latinx party ❤️‍🔥 Las Malin
 ches presents: La Telenovela Love. Betrayal. Revenge. Perreo. Your invitat
 ion to the premiere of La Telenovela has arrived. Inspired by one of Latin
  America&#x27\;s most iconic cultural traditions\, this edition celebrates
  the drama\, romance\, glamour\, and unforgettable plot twists that made t
 elenovelas legendary\, all reimagined through a sapphic Latinx dance floor
 . 🎬 Walk the red carpet (yes\, literally)\, strike a pose for the papar
 azzi\, and become the main character. Inside you&#x27\;ll find: ❤️‍
 🔥 Live performances 🎧 Reggaetón\, dembow\, Latin pop\, cumbia &amp\
 ; bachata 📺 Iconic telenovela soundtracks?? ✨ Immersive visuals &amp\
 ; theatrical moments Whether you&#x27\;re the hopeless romantic\, the glam
 orous villain\, or simply here to perrear\, this night is yours. 🎧 Line
 up ❤️‍🔥 La Malinche A Mexican sapphic DJ based in Toronto\, blend
 ing reggaetón\, neo perreo\, Latin pop\, and cumbia into high-energy sets
  built for dancing\, singing along\, and celebrating Latinidad. Special Gu
 est DJ ❤️‍🔥 Litney Litney is a Toronto-based Afro-Latinx DJ whose
  high-energy sets fuse dembow\, baile funk\, ballroom\, dancehall\, bubbli
 n club\, and rave-ready bangers. After performing at Boiler Room\, HOE_MIE
 S Berlin\, and Pxssy Palace\, and opening for Tokischa\, she&#x27\;s ready
  to take La Telenovela to its unforgettable season finale. 🎬 🎭 Featu
 red Performance 🌹 RRRicardo La Dulce Straight from Mexico\, RRRicardo L
 a Dulce is a flamenco drag king bringing drama\, romance\, and irresistibl
 e flirtation to La Telenovela. Prepare to fall in love. 📍 Venue: Rivoli
  332-334 Queen St W 📅 Saturday\, September 5 ⏰ 09:30 PM – 2:30 AM 
 🎬 Dress Code (Optional) The cameras are rolling. ✨ Main character 
 💄 Glamorous villain 🌹 Telenovela glamour 📸 Red carpet ready Costu
 mes are encouraged\, never required. ❤️‍🔥 PLEASE READ BEFORE PURC
 HASING Las Malinches is an intentionally curated sapphic Latin space. We u
 nderstand that sapphic identity is broad\, personal\, and experienced in m
 any different ways. We welcome people across the sapphic spectrum and are 
 committed to creating a space rooted in Latinidad\, respect\, safety\, and
  belonging. To preserve the purpose of this event\, Las Malinches is not o
 pen to cisgender men. This is a private 19+ gathering. A valid physical go
 vernment-issued ID is required for entry. 📸 Photography and video will 
 be captured throughout the night. By attending\, you acknowledge that medi
 a may be taken during the event. If you&#x27\;d prefer not to appear in ph
 otos or videos\, please let a member of our team know and we&#x27\;ll do o
 ur best to accommodate you. ‍
LOCATION:The Rivoli\, 334 Queen Street West
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/las-malinches-presents-la-telenovela
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
