 in fully accessible venues!) Theme: Angels &amp\; Demons Music Vibe: Music
  vibes will be DnB\, Dubstep\, Techno\, Bass &amp\; beyond. An eclectic co
 mpilation of delicious cult hits and deep cuts. Important: This is not an 
 adult play/kink/s3x party. Supersexe is an event for queer/trans/femme pre
 senting people. If you do not fall under this bracket\, you must be accomp
 anied by someone who does. NO REFUNDS Behind SUPERSEXE: A queer-led event\
 , spotlighting alternative artists and performers. SUPERSEXE is named afte
 r the now-closed Montreal-based strip club\, Super Sexe\, that unfortunate
 ly burnt down in 2021. I (Stella) had always wanted to go since I was a ki
 d. The glitzy exterior\, the beautiful femme style\, the extravagance. I w
 anted to encapsulate the image in my head of what could&#x27\;ve been thro
 ugh this series (yes\, series!) of SUPERSEXE. ‍
LOCATION:See-Scape\, 347 Keele St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/supersexe---angels-demons
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
