BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SHANGO featuring John Morales and Kiki LeFreak
DTSTART:20260926T220000
DTEND:20260926T220000
UID:fac7ef40c42f415272a67447482fb173@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Shango’s debut at Standard Time with the NYC legend JOHN MOR
 ALES\, With Kiki LeFreak and Iced Misto Shango is Toronto’s favourite un
 derground party for the freaks\, geeks\, queers\, dancers and heads! We ar
 e very excited to announce John Morales! - John is one of the most recogni
 sed names in dance music history\, as a Remixer/Producer/Dj. Mixing and pr
 oducing some of the biggest dance music tracks of all time\, as well as DJ
 ’ing at some of the most famous and prestigious venues in the world. Joh
 n Morales has become one of the most in demand and respected Dj’s. He ha
 s toured Australia\, New Zealand and countries around the world\, John has
  his Defected Glitterbox at Hi in Ibiza and Ministry Of Sound London. John
  has also performed at various world renown festivals Including Defected C
 roatia\,Southport Weekender\, and 51st State in London to name a few. In m
 usic\, and especially in underground music\, the word “legend” is thro
 wn around to the point where it loses all meaning. What is a legend? It’
 s someone who broke the mold – someone whose sounds\, techniques – eve
 n his style – changed things forever. It’s a pioneer that everyone who
  followed after emulated\, whether consciously or not. In dance music\, th
 e person you’re talking about is John Morales. Supported by Toronto loca
 l favs Kiki LeFreak and Iced Misto. SHANGO is a safe space. PLUR in full e
 ffect Peace Love Unity and Respect. NO judgement\, homophobia\, racism\, s
 exual harassment or unwanted touching 10pm to LATE Standard Time 165 Geary
  Ave ‍
LOCATION:Standard Time\, 165 Geary Avenue #2nd Floor Unit A
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/shango-featuring-john-morales-and-kiki-lef
 reak
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:RIVALS Dirty Ugly: A Dirty Dancing &amp\; Coyote Ugly Drag Brunch 
 @ Gusto 101
DTSTART:20260927T120500
DTEND:20260927T120500
UID:8622d2e2674acdf5c5e495e198384ca6@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:The only time you can put baby in a corner... is at drag brunc
 h! Dirty Ugly brings the heat\, the heels\, and the highest level of camp 
 to Gusto 101 for a wild mashup of two iconic cult classics: Coyote Ugly an
 d Dirty Dancing. Get ready for a brunch experience packed with bar-top ene
 rgy\, legendary dance moves\, and a whole lot of “Nobody puts Baby in a 
 corner” attitude. From sultry performances to laugh-out-loud comedy\, th
 is is where messy meets magical and the only thing dirtier than the dancin
 g is the tea being spilled. Hosted by Toronto’s own Sucka Queen\, Dirty 
 Ugly Drag Brunch is a celebration of big personalities\, bigger performanc
 es\, and unapologetic fun. Grab your friends\, enjoy Gusto 101’s iconic 
 food and drinks\, and prepare for a Sunday you won’t forget — because 
