DESCRIPTION:ART♡THROB returns September 27th! Black Eagle @blackeagletor
 onto 457 Church St\, Toronto 4-8PM\, Free\, 19+! A pop-up market &amp\; so
 cial event featuring queer illustration\, art\, prints\, comics + more! Fe
 aturing @kylepcahill @z.oot + Key @lil.darnie Paprikachunk @peteellisonstu
 dio @tylermannart + Mordred. Amazing poster illustration by Kyle Cahill! -
 -- Many of you may already know that our dear artist friend Patches tragic
 ally passed away earlier this year due to Addison&#x27\;s Disease. He was 
 a beloved member of our community and an amazingly talented artist\, havin
 g participated in ART♡THROB several times. He was a great friend to many
  of us and had a way of always creating community around him\, both a cent
 ral part of the queer art and leather communities (and too many other frie
 nd circles to count). He continues to be dearly missed. We have a small se
 lection of his digital prints\, which he had previously sold at ART♡THRO
 B\, and would like to share them with folks who can contribute a donation 
 to Rainbow Railroad at the event. We&#x27\;ll have more info about this fu
 ndraiser at the event. ‍
